:PATH
Chapter 3 Referendum and Commencement
|

:INFO
Art. 85
1 This Act is subject to optional referendum.
2 The Federal Council shall determine the commencement date.
Commencement date: 1 November 1992
|

:NOTE
Para. 2 — FCD of 5 Oct. 1992.

